WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,220
Not an order

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,620
Since I promised your father

3
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:03,820
this is my job

4
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:04,820
for your safety

5
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,820
You'd better cooperate with me

6
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,340
What a joke

7
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:10,540
I'm living a good life and I still need to cooperate with you

8
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:13,340
I will give you two choices now. First

9
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,740
Get double the money

10
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,050
Disappear immediately from my eyes second

11
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:19,880
I'll fire you now

12
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,600
I was appointed by the group

13
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,000
You have no right to fire me

14
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,780
Then you can give it a try

15
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:31,270
Yes that is

16
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,470
I don’t believe I can’t even be an assistant.

17
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:38,650
I'm going to call people in now

18
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,120
what are you doing

19
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,520
What are you doing here with a table?

20
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:46,050
Please explain to me who asked you to carry it in.

21
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:48,050
What's going on Mr. Zhang?

22
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:50,380
This is what the president personally ordered before

23
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:52,580
The president ordered me to be in your office

24
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:53,780
Add a desk

25
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,180
New assistant to general manager

26
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:58,410
Just like you working in the same office

27
00:00:58,410 --> 00:00:59,810
Work in my office

28
00:00:59,810 --> 00:01:01,810
I don't care who told you to do this

29
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:07,820
Now, please carry the table out to Mr. Zhang right away.

30
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:11,140
This was personally ordered by the president

31
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,740
My dad's orders are orders.

32
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:14,740
Isn’t my order an order?

33
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:16,940
I don't care who told you to do this

34
00:01:16,940 --> 00:01:19,060
Carry the table out for me immediately

35
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:22,060
Otherwise, don’t come to the company tomorrow, Mr. Zhang

36
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:23,260
The president also said

37
00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:24,860
If I don't fulfill his orders

38
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:27,760
Just fire me, Mr. Zhang

39
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:30,160
You see, I have been with you for so many years

40
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,560
Okay, okay, stop crying

41
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:37,000
Thank you Mr. Zhang for waiting.

42
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,600
The table can stay

43
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:39,600
but you now

44
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,400
Immediately go to the human resources department and go through the procedures Mr. Zhang

45
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,600
what procedure

46
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,600
I sign and seal

47
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:47,650
This so-called assistant to the general manager was fired

48
00:01:47,650 --> 00:01:49,450
What happened to Mr. Zhang?

49
00:01:49,450 --> 00:01:50,850
Appointment of Assistant Chen

50
00:01:50,850 --> 00:01:53,280
Our company has no right to interfere

51
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:55,340
you are telling me

52
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:57,940
I'm not even qualified to fire him, am I?
